## Where the EV charging directory started {% #started %}

I'm Sunny Patel, and I own and run this UK EV charging directory. Google Search Console data, pulled on 4 October 2026, shows the directory earning 8 clicks from 864 impressions in April 2026, with daily impressions between 13 and 58. In September 2026 the same directory earned 2,834 clicks from 122,593 impressions. Monthly Google clicks therefore rose from 8 to 2,834 across the six calendar months from April to September 2026.

The growth came in a step, then a climb. Impressions for the EV charging directory moved from 62 on 14 May 2026 to 391 on 15 May and 1,001 on 16 May, and clicks moved from 0 on 14 May to 12 and 18 on the same two days. After that, monthly Google clicks rose every month: 188 in May, 622 in June, 1,495 in July, 2,236 in August and 2,834 in September.

